      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí está la consulta SQL SELECT para BigQuery que identifica las especialidades médicas de los profesionales que diagnosticaron náuseas (Concept ID: 31967) y el recuento de pacientes diagnosticados por especialidad:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    sc.concept_name AS specialty_name,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT co.person_id) AS patient_count\nFROM\n    `condition_occurrence` AS co\nJOIN\n    `provider` AS p\n    ON co.provider_id = p.provider_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS sc\n    ON p.specialty_concept_id = sc.concept_id\nWHERE\n    co.condition_concept_id = 31967\nGROUP BY\n    sc.concept_name\nORDER BY\n    patient_count DESC;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnEBjz1rX6gake3jYqBiQl1Dzaq7rftdoBugzUujz212skB3kvBfr6s2kG3VL-GMq-YOiSyfTQtGeMF3Cq8eF-rg-lDog3KqxiPLTFREP-fIzP7whJaJ7ZvR0ORPn8fXu1NPp4Mzt9qhdx7oee85Do1u0Q=="
